{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggle and survive in turn-based pawn shop showdowns!</strong> As heir to a family shop, each customer becomes a strategic negotiation battle. Execute perfect &quot;attacks&quot; to bend prices your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Items Index</strong>,\u00a0every successful haggle adds unique treasures to your collection. But <strong>rent hits weekly</strong>: balance cash for bills against inventory investment. Overextend and face insolvency; play safe and miss opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the family legacy alive?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Turn-Based Negotiation Battles \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off one-on-one with customers in tense, strategic pricing duels. Choose your &quot;attacks&quot;\u2014discounts, persuasive pitches, and more\u2014to tip the deal in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/e5bea73f5288a98df7617ae1acad0076.poster.avif?t=1756842195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/e5bea73f5288a98df7617ae1acad0076.webm?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/e5bea73f5288a98df7617ae1acad0076.mp4?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Items Index Collection System \ud83e\udde9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your negotiation history in a growing Items Index. Complete the catalog to unlock bragging rights (and maybe some  business secrets?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/2640d802c937f1bd0512c4b3bfcd1640.poster.avif?t=1756842195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/2640d802c937f1bd0512c4b3bfcd1640.webm?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/2640d802c937f1bd0512c4b3bfcd1640.mp4?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Tight Financial Strategy \ud83d\udcc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent and utilities while making enough profits to stock new, valuable goods. Financial mismanagement could bankrupt your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/45e62db4f9c375abf2ab9ca3dd323886.poster.avif?t=1756842195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/45e62db4f9c375abf2ab9ca3dd323886.webm?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952520/extras/45e62db4f9c375abf2ab9ca3dd323886.mp4?t=1756842195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Family Legacy &amp; Golden Deals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve your family\u2019s pawn shop legacy by making smart deals, clever investments, and becoming known as the savviest shop in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>strategy, high-stakes bargaining, and treasure hunting under pressure</strong>, your pawn shop awaits!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952520?t=1756842195","b